# Normalize all text to UTF-8 with LF line endings in the repository.
# The PowerShell agent is ASCII-only by design; Chinese text lives in Markdown,
# JSON locales, and the HTML test pages, all of which are UTF-8 without BOM.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
